      "quote-158697bb2c6757",
      "quote-fd1898835d9a97"
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "on losing while playing for Team Canada",
     "text": "I've had a lot of joy, a lot of luck in the past with Team Canada. I feel like things fell my way a lot of times. It wasn't the case today.",
