    {
     "label": "on Jannik Sinner ahead of his knee surgery",
     "text": "Jannik is the driving force behind Italian tennis and, for me, he represents a great source of inspiration because of his ambition and the results he has managed to achieve. I genuinely wish him all the best. He has a very well-organised and professional team behind him, who will know how to help him make the best decisions. I am convinced that he will come back stronger than before.",
     "from": [
      "quote-480aa71dc9de96",
      "quote-608e0da2df75d2"
     ]
    }
