    {
     "label": "on Felix auger-aliassime and his path to the top",
     "text": "Felix is a great guy. He was a superstar from childhood, the kind of player everyone said would reach the top one day. And he did it. His path to success was a little different; he got there a bit earlier than me.",
     "from": [
      "quote-23b0add5e54b6d"
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "on the advantage of working with Fred",
     "text": "I think it can be a great advantage for us. There is nobody in the tennis world who knows Felix better than Fred. He grew up with him, developed him as a tennis player and took him into the world's top five.",
     "from": [
      "quote-e8d792a0345fc9"
